        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita matuku a bungi, ne hakamana Yehowa kuha Bena Isalele dikisha kudi bena lukuna babo bonso bakadi babanyunguluka, ne hakalua Yoshua muntu mununu ne bidimu biandi biakakumbana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua wakabikila Bena Isalele bonso ne bakulu babo ne bakadi ku mutu kua bisamba biabo ne balumbuluishi babo ne tuhita tuabo, wakabambila ne, Meme ndi muntu mununu, ne bidimu bianyi biakukumbana: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuenu nuakatangila malu onso akenzela Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, bisamba ebi bionso bua bualu buenu; bualu bua Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, yeye mene wakanuluila nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai, meme nakanuha bisamba ebi bidi bishala bu buhianyi bua bisamba bienu, kutuadishila ku Yadene, ne bisamba bionso binakatamba bukole, tô ne ku mai manene kudi kubuelela diba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, neabumushe ku mpala kuenu, neabihate ku mesu kuenu: nuenu nenunyenge buloba buabo bu muakanuambila Yehowa, Nzambi wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nuikale ne mitshima ya dikima bua kutumikila ne kuenza mei onso adi mafunda mu mukanda wa mikenji ya Mose; kanusesuki ku tshianza tshia balume anyi ku tshianza tshia bakashi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanubuelakanyi ne bisamba ebi bidi bishala munkatshi muenu; kanutedi mena a nzambi yabo, kanuditshihi kudiyi, kanuyikuatshidi mudimu, kanuyikukuidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lamatai Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, bu munuakuenza tô ne ku dituku edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakanuihatshila bisamba binene ne bikole; kakuakadi muntu wakanutantamena tô ne ku dituku edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umue wenu neihate tshinunu tshia bantu; bualu bua Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, udi unuluila nvita bu muakanuambileye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nudimuke bienu bua nuenu nusue Yehowa, Nzambi wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi binuahingana bua kulamata bisamba ebi bidi bishala munkatshi muenu, ne bua kubakangana nʼabo, ne bua kubuelakana nʼabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "numanye bienu ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, nealekele kunuihatshila bisamba ebi ku mpala kuenu; nebikale bu buteyi ne dijimba kunudi, ne bu nfimbu ha nyima henu, ne bu meba mu mesu enu tô ne hanubutulabo mu buloba ebu buimpe buakanuha Yehowa, Nzambi wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai, lelu eu nkadi ha kuya mu nshila utu waya bonso ba ha buloba: nudi bamanye mu mitshima yenu yonso ne mu mioyo yenu yonso ne kanuakahanga tshintu tshimpe tshimue tshiakanuha Yehowa, Nzambi wenu; nuakaheta bintu bionso, kanuakahanga tshintu tshimue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu munuakaheta bintu bimpe bionso biakanuambila Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, nunku Yehowa neanutumine malu mabi onso tô ne hanubutuleye mu buloba ebu buimpe buakanuha Yehowa, Nzambi wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binuashiha tshihungidi tshia Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, tshinuakahunga nʼandi, ne binuaya bua kukuatshila nzambi mikuabo mudimu ne bua kuyikukuila, hashishe Yehowa neikale nʼenu tshiji, nenujimine lubilu mu buloba buimpe buakanuheye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
